e role before investing in the application",{"href":"#section-4","children":"Verify the role before investing in the application"}],["$","a","Separate essential and preferred requirements",{"href":"#section-5","children":"Separate essential and preferred requirements"}],["$","a","Check the placement's practical value",{"href":"#section-6","children":"Check the placement's practical value"}],["$","a","Prepare for tests and interviews",{"href":"#section-7","children":"Prepare for tests and interviews"}],["$","a","Submit accurately and track the result",{"href":"#section-8","children":"Submit accurately and track the result"}],["$","a","Track the document, its owner and its status",{"href":"#section-9","children":"Track the document, its owner and its status"}]]}]]}],false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,["$","article",null,{"className":"article-body article-body--guide","children":[["$","section","0-Decide whether the placement is usable before applying",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-1","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Decide whether the placement is usable before applying"}],[["$","p","An impressive organisation name does not establish that the role fits your degree, budget or right to work. The employer’s current vacancy is the source for eligibility and benefits; an internship listing is not a visa decision.",{"children":"An impressive organisation name does not establish that the role fits your degree, budget or right to work. The employer’s current vacancy is the source for eligibility and benefits; an internship listing is not a visa decision."}]],"$undefined",[["$","p",null,{"className":"table-scroll-hint","children":"On a small screen, scroll the table sideways to compare all columns."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-table-wrap","role":"region","aria-label":"Decide whether the placement is usable before applying","tabIndex":0,"children":"$L1a"}],